[{"title":"留题龙隐岩寺","author":"李师中","text":"绝顶神灵宅，危空宝榻开。\n层□□□□，□德出氛埃。\n□□□□□，岩光□□来。\n□□□一息，鸣鸟共徘徊。","collection":"宋","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60006,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"递中得先之兄书取邕钦宜柳归约十二月到此年节已近未闻来朝寄奉 其一","author":"李师中","text":"我在漓江上，君行瘴海浔。\n因劳南去梦，暂望北归心。\n别后年华改，新来雨露深。\n凭栏望书信，一字抵千金。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60007,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"中隐岩 其一","author":"李师中","text":"访隐寻幽缓著鞭，梅花初试小春天。\n孤峰上下分三洞，一水萦纡溉万田。\n好向忙中抛俗事，却来闲处觅神仙。\n清虚不似人间世，野鹤飞云绕槛前。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60008,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"过严关有感 其一","author":"李师中","text":"大抵孤忠报国难，古今共是一长叹。\n玉关还路春无绿，定远归来鬓已斑。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60009,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"诗一首","author":"李师中","text":"鉴中双鬓已蹉跎，无计重挥却日戈。\n已是园林春欲暮，那堪风雨夜来多。\n诗成白也知无敌，花落虞兮可奈何。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60010,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"客有写真者见予因以三诗赠之 其一","author":"李师中","text":"嗟予少也贱，到老尚无功。\n方寸浮名外，流年两鬓中。\n对镜犹惭愧，图写若为容。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60011,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送唐介进退韵","author":"李师中","text":"孤忠自许众不与，独立敢言人所难。\n去国一身轻似叶，高名千古重于山。\n并游英俊颜何厚，未死奸谀骨已寒。\n天为吾君扶社稷，肯教夫子不生还。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60012,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"留题龙隐岩","author":"李师中","text":"过江缘磴寻溪垠，隐然绝壁天开门。\n传云此处昔龙隐，阴岩凛凛犹疑存。\n风云已与时变会，苔藓尚迹初潜痕。\n嗟余出处不自重，过事轻发难为神。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60013,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"留题龙隐岩□□","author":"李师中","text":"乱峰凝碧□□□，曾有神龙此□□。\n□□已兴甘泽去，高岩□葛□云端。","collection":"宋","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60014,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"递中得先之兄书取邕钦宜柳归约十二月到此年节已近未闻来朝寄奉 其二","author":"李师中","text":"远宦良多感，新来更可悲。\n春随斗柄动，人自海边归。\n仆马疲劳甚，郊原雨水时。\n经旬不得信，凭槛又吟诗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60015,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题太空子隐居","author":"李师中","text":"可道非常道，真空本不空。\n荒郊自生草，閒地又栽松。\n无欲更何虑，有为终必穷。\n风云上天去，老子信犹龙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60016,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠韩迥","author":"李师中","text":"未衰前已得悬车，骨立清风八十馀。\n松竹最宜贫宅舍，江山遍照白髭须。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60017,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"菩萨蛮","author":"李师中","text":"子规啼破城楼月。\n画船晓载笙歌发。\n两岸荔枝红。\n万家烟雨中。\n佳人相对泣。\n泪下罗衣湿。\n从此信音稀。\n岭南无雁飞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60018,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其二","author":"李师中","text":"门无车马地无尘，只有青山是四邻。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60019,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其六","author":"李师中","text":"对面好峰横翠幕，绕城垂柳拂清涟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60020,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其一","author":"李师中","text":"好斩佞人头上血，来充行客酒中杯。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60021,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其四","author":"李师中","text":"山响催茶候，梅蒸熟荔天。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60022,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其七","author":"李师中","text":"兜鍪不胜任，犹可冠貂蝉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60023,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其三","author":"李师中","text":"坐据白云岩下地，仰看青镜匣中天。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60024,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其十","author":"李师中","text":"当年殿柱题名处。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60025,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其九","author":"李师中","text":"山如仁者静，风似圣之清。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60026,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其八","author":"李师中","text":"夜如何其斗欲落，岁云莫矣天无晴。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60027,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其五","author":"李师中","text":"门掩苍苔柳半遮，春深庭院日初斜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60028,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游台感兴古风","author":"李师圣","text":"梵书五顶清凉府，冬冰夏雪无炎暑。\n我来七月秋正寒，何况萧萧岩谷雨。\n偶尔云开煦气生，溶溶满目烟光聚。\n真容古基鹫峰寺，高山之麓雄今古。\n西方楼观缥缈间，粲然金碧莲华宇。\n悬崖峻岭架大木，神物所持凭险阻。\n金珰垂空殿檐响，森森铁凤相交舞。\n忆昔文殊出火宅，金刚宝窟通真土。\n牵牛老人饮玉泉，二子一犬随贫女。\n变化无方利有情，知是西天七佛祖。\n重闻清凉境界真，无穷陈迹书妙语。\n我有诚心颇出群，瑞应神奇目亲睹。\n须臾光相现咫尺，玉洞金灯明可数。\n松影摇空山谷中，夜寂太阴隐龙虎。\n丹楼碧阁香案前，敬畏生心谁敢侮。\n从来昏迷如梦回，前三后三慎莫取。\n我今不作前后想，香烟稽首清凉主。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60029,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其二","author":"李庆孙","text":"四夷妙赋无人诵，三酌酸文举世传。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60030,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其一","author":"李庆孙","text":"轴装曲谱金书字，树记花名玉篆牌。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60031,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"登岳阳楼","author":"李延永","text":"转地倾荆水，连天涨洞庭。\n势疑吞郡邑，怒欲辟雷霆。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60032,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游大涤","author":"李廷忠","text":"清溪路入武陵源，鸡犬人家隔近村。\n拔地一峰危作柱，栖云五洞窄开门。\n空庭有客扫松影，古径无人踏藓痕。\n我欲白云岩畔宿，月明一夜听啼猿。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60033,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"卜算子 萧计议席上","author":"李廷忠","text":"草际雪痕消，梅上春心动。\n碧幕红裙簇画筵，横玉声三弄。\n雅兴杂鱼龙，妙舞回鸾凤。\n莫道司空眼惯□，还入清宵梦。","collection":"宋","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60034,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"水龙吟 寿宁国太守王大卿正月二日","author":"李廷忠","text":"风流最数宣城，奇山秀水神仙府。\n琴高台畔，花姑坛上，鸾翔凤舞。\n春度玉墀，月升金掌，荣分铜虎。\n想少陵，知有异人间出，三百载、留佳句。\n岁岁椒盘柏斝，到明朝、又还重举。\n阳和散作，千岩瑞雪，两溪甘雨。\n汲取恩波，酿成禄酒，庆公初度。\n有东风传报，都人已为，筑沙堤路。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60035,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"水调歌头 武昌南楼落成，次王漕韵","author":"李廷忠","text":"抚景几今古，遗恨此江山。\n百年形胜，但见幽草杂枯菅。\n多少名流登览，赖有神扶坏栋，诗墨尚斑斑。\n风月要磨洗，顾我已衰颜。\n擎天手，携玉斧，到江干。\n一新奇观，领客觞咏有馀闲。\n烟草半川开霁，城郭两州相望，都在画屏间。\n便拟骑黄鹄，直上扣云关。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60036,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"生查子","author":"李廷忠","text":"玉女翠帷熏，香粉开妆面。\n不是占春迟，羞被群花见。\n纤手折柔条，绛雪飞千片。\n流入紫金卮，未许停歌扇。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60037,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"庆清朝 上楼大参十一月十五","author":"李廷忠","text":"天启重光，地钟上瑞，有人起自东山。\n当年谢傅，几曾鹤发貂冠。\n不似文章隽老，重来鸣步斗枢间。\n洪钧转，五原草绿，太白兵闲。\n运庆今朝初度，正日添纹线，月挂冰盘。\n恩重御壶宣劝，喜溢天颜。\n听取沙堤好语，金科红篆押千官。\n春长在，调元鼎里，不假还丹。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60038,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"沁园春 刘总干会饮同寮，出示新词，席上用韵","author":"李廷忠","text":"幕府增辉，前度刘郎，又还到来。\n看芙蓉池畔，神凝秋水，绮罗丛里，欢动春雷。\n彩笔新题，金钗半醉，当日英雄安在哉。\n开筵处，是真仙福地，不著纤埃。\n堪怜倦客情怀。\n听吹竹弹丝金奏谐。\n有黄花插鬓，何妨敧帽，绿橙醒酒，莫惜空罍。\n坐上疏狂，帘间姝丽，应想横波一笑回。\n停杯久，待娇歌缓劝，归骑休催。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60039,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"临江仙 其一 寿刘子野","author":"李廷忠","text":"人物风流真罕见，何须尘外求仙。\n绿龟千岁稳巢莲。\n醉倾金凿落，笑拥玉婵娟。\n须信日边消息好，寒花也作春妍。\n笙歌乐地酒中天。\n功名无限事，都在寿觞前。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60040,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"临江仙 其二 寿师幕","author":"李廷忠","text":"秋到三山呈瑞气，斑斑绣虎文章。\n早分桂殿一枝香。\n婉谋参幕府，华署等朝行。\n驾月姮娥来献寿，胜如昨夜辉光。\n十分满劝紫霞觞。\n年年花萼宴，相约侍君王。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60041,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"贺新郎 寿制帅董侍郎","author":"李廷忠","text":"濯锦江头路。\n望祥云、密拥旌幢，初开天府。\n冰露壶中秋玉莹，不著人间烦暑。\n现物表、神仙风度。\n回首太清宫阙杳，是鸣珂簪笔遨游处。\n舟万斛，却西诉。\n筹边堂上兵无数。\n笑当年、蜀山谅将，夜分旗鼓。\n听取今朝宣阃令，洗尽蛮烟塞雾。\n便催唤、衮衣归去。\n运应河清逢岳诞，办中兴事业须申甫。\n看岁岁，寿觞举。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60042,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"感皇恩 寿王节使","author":"李廷忠","text":"昨夜一星明，太微西畔。\n应得良朝诞名将。\n豹韬龙节，谈笑坐清江汉。\n年年梅雪里、开华宴。\n铁券高勋，金钟洪算。\n要同宗社流芳远。\n玺书褒异，自得君王深眷。\n看看登剑履、明光殿。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60043,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"满江红 上夔师乐秘阁生日","author":"李廷忠","text":"玉帐西来，道前是、绣衣使者。\n游览处、秋风鼓吹，自天而下。\n湘水得霜清可鉴，巫峰过雨森如画。\n有神仙、佳致在胸襟，真潇洒。\n荆州宝，元无价。\n夔门政，长多暇。\n听谈兵樽俎，百川倾泻。\n此日寿觞容我劝，他年枢柄还公把。\n趁桂花、时节去朝天，香随马。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60044,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"瑞鹧鸪","author":"李廷忠","text":"洛浦风光烂漫时。\n千金开宴醉为期。\n花方著雨犹含笑，蝶不禁寒总是痴。\n香腮擎吐浓华艳，不随桃李竞春菲。\n东君自有回天力，看把花枝带月归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60045,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"踏莎行 赵宽夫十二月十二日生，赋此为寿","author":"李廷忠","text":"星野涵辉，云峰环翠。\n南园迎腊开梅蕊。\n瑶台仙子笑相逢，金钗行里拼沈醉。\n照乘骊珠，出闲天骥。\n相随寿母多年纪。\n春风侍宴宝花楼，五枝七叶都荣贵。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60046,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"鹧鸪天 九日南楼和范总干韵","author":"李廷忠","text":"槛外长江浪拍空。\n萧萧红蓼白蘋风。\n三秋告稔三农庆，九日追欢九客同。\n烟渚北，月岩东。\n莫嫌光景太匆匆。\n登龙戏马英雄事，都在南楼一啸中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60047,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"霜天晓角 庆高尉","author":"李廷忠","text":"洞天仙伯。\n总是梅标格。\n来索东风一笑，香浮动、潜溪月。\n寿尊谁共酌。\n少年花县客。\n试问日边春信，梁园上、正飞雪。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60048,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"信美台","author":"李当遇","text":"零陵郡北云帆落，信美台前江月明。\n石浅风高滩濑急，孤舟一夜听寒声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60049,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"端砚","author":"李朴","text":"岩石凝清粹，端然绝世珍。\n声清轻楚玉，色润胜燕珉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60050,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"庆清朝","author":"李朴","text":"晓庭天离，擎香肖紫，严瑞气满春彰。\n勋门旧擎，从来功在江南。\n二百岁中阴德去，今天府享潭潭。\n遵画一，记得那时，□□□□。\n且趁东风解冻，向柳梢青处，□□□□。\n□□听满，此夕何惜醺酣。\n醉挹寿卿春色，一帘花影转微蟾。\n千秋岁，愿祝算数□，多似彭聃。","collection":"宋","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60051,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"分水铺","author":"李次渊","text":"青山北去连吴会，绿水东流到八闽。\n何必此中分界限，普天率土尽王臣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60052,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"乾溪铺","author":"李次渊","text":"芦芽抽尽柳花黄，水满田头未插秧。\n客里不知春事晚，举头惊见楝花香。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60053,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"郎官湖春日四首 其四","author":"李祁","text":"十日春阴到水亭，水边杨柳一时青。\n梅花过尽桃花恶，乞取山矾入净瓶。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60054,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"郎官湖春日四首 其三","author":"李祁","text":"朦胧花影月黄昏，著意春风入酒痕。\n知是江梅喜佳客，倒垂花蕊照清樽。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60055,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"郎官湖春日四首 其二","author":"李祁","text":"空山玉蕊照琼瑰，到处寻花共往回。\n欲识春风最奇处，试来同看雨中梅。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60056,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"郎官湖春日四首 其一","author":"李祁","text":"两山收雨暗平沙，遮断溪梅隔水花。\n留得烟林作图画，依稀松磴有人家。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60057,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"水龙吟 郎官湖","author":"李祁","text":"碧山横绕清湖，茂林秀麓波光里。\n南宫老大，西洲漂荡，危亭重倚。\n雨步云行，饵风饮雾，平生游戏。\n笑此中空洞，都无一物，有神妙、浩然气。\n扫尽云南梦北，看三江五湖秋水。\n狂歌两解，清尊一举，超然千里。\n江汉苍茫，故人何处，山川良是。\n待白蘋露下，青天月上，约骑鲸起。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60058,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"如梦令 其一","author":"李祁","text":"春水湖塘深处。\n竹暗沙洲无路。\n闲伴落花来，却信东风归去。\n且住。\n且住。\n细看两山烟雨。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60059,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"如梦令 其二","author":"李祁","text":"不见玉人清晓。\n长啸一声云杪。\n碧水满阑塘，竹外一枝风袅。\n奇妙。\n奇妙。\n半夜山空月皎。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60060,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"西江月 其二","author":"李祁","text":"云观三山清露，长生万鬣青松。\n琼璈珠珥下秋空。\n一笑满天鸾凤。\n雾鬓新梳绀绿，霞衣旧佩柔红。\n更邀豪俊驭南风。\n此意平生飞动。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60061,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"西江月 其一","author":"李祁","text":"拾翠亭前水满，郎官湖上春回。\n仪龙新碾试琼杯。\n更觉春江有味。\n拄杖行穿翠筱，吹花醉绕江梅。\n故园心事老相催。\n此意陶潜能会。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60062,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"阮郎归","author":"李祁","text":"校书学士小蓬山。\n新参玉笋班。\n买花归去五湖间。\n浣花龙尾湾。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60063,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"青玉案","author":"李祁","text":"绿琐窗纱明月透。\n正清梦、莺啼柳。\n碧井银瓶鸣玉甃。\n翔鸾妆样，粲花衫绣。\n分付春风手。\n喜入秋波娇欲溜。\n脉脉青山两眉秀。\n玉枕春寒郎知否。\n归来留取，御香襟袖。\n同饮酴醾酒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60064,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"南歌子","author":"李祁","text":"袅袅秋风起，萧萧败叶声。\n岳阳楼上听哀筝。\n楼下凄凉江月、为谁明。\n雾雨沈云梦，烟波渺洞庭。\n可怜无处问湘灵。\n只有无情江水、绕孤城。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60065,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"点绛唇","author":"李祁","text":"楼下清歌，水流歌断春风暮。\n梦云烟树。\n依约江南路。\n碧水黄沙，梦到寻梅处。\n花无数。\n问花无语。\n明月随人去。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60066,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"浪淘沙令","author":"李祁","text":"拍手趁西风。\n惊起乖龙。\n青山绿水古今同。\n唯有一轮山上月，长照江中。\n一点落金钟。\n浑似虚空。\n道人不住有云峰。\n但是人家清酒瓮，行处相逢。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60067,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"减字木兰花","author":"李祁","text":"梨花院宇。\n澹月倾云初过雨。\n一枕轻寒。\n梦入西瑶小道山。\n花深人静。\n帘锁御香清昼永。\n红药阑干。\n玉案春风窈窕间。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60068,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"朝中措","author":"李祁","text":"郎官湖上探春回。\n初见照江梅。\n过尽竹溪流水，无人知道花开。\n佳人何处，江南梦远，殊未归来。\n唤取小丛教看，隔江烟雨楼台。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60069,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"鹊桥仙","author":"李祁","text":"春阴淡淡，春波渺渺，帘卷花稍香雾。\n小舟谁在落梅村，正梦绕、清溪烟雨。\n碧山学士，云房娇小，须要五湖同去。\n桃花流水鳜鱼肥，恰趁得、江天佳处。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60070,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"醉桃源","author":"李祁","text":"春风碧水满郎湖。\n水清梅影疏。\n渡江桃叶酒家垆。\n髻鬟云样梳。\n吹玉蕊，饮琼腴。\n不须红袖扶。\n少年随意数花须。\n老来心已无。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60071,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其一","author":"李祁","text":"归家勿忧御史雨，明月正满郎官湖。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60072,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}}]